# Stench of Evil destroys every Plains, then asks each Plains' controller whether to pay {2} against its damage (CR
# 118.12): whatever they answer, Bot1's enchanted Plains has been destroyed by the spell, so Equinox counters it (CR
# 608.2). The payments that follow the destruction need not be tried one by one: what has been destroyed stays destroyed.

